The files in this directory, v<release>.json, are extracts of MITRE ATT&CK(R) Enterprise releases:
technique ids and names, each sub-technique's parent, tactics, platforms, deprecated techniques, and
revoked techniques with their successors. Each was built from MITRE's enterprise STIX bundle for its
release, published at https://github.com/mitre-attack/attack-stix-data; the file's "source" field
gives the bundle's URL and sha256. v20.0.json is the extract ace3 ships as etc/attack/v20.0.json,
unchanged. `ace svs attack extract` builds one (crates/ace-core/src/svs/attack.rs).

